flowchart LR
    subgraph Main[Main Thread]
        SM[State machine + control output]:::control
    end
    CT[CameraThread<br/>Picamera2 → cv2<br/>Condition + counter]:::sensor
    ST[SensorThread<br/>TCA9548A → 3×ToF<br/>+ rear VL53L8CX]:::sensor
